  "description": "Report definitions for DocWright: a mutable, lossless object model for SSRS / Power BI paginated reports (RDL), designed for a report designer to load, edit and save without discarding anything it does not understand; the report expression engine, report processing against host-supplied data, and pagination into a page model that PDF and image renderers draw. Serialization lives in DocWright.Reporting.Rdl.",
